# Nuxt Content — Posts

## Collection

- `content.config.ts`: collection `posts` (`type: 'page'`, source `posts/**/*.md`).
- Schema: `title`, `description`, `date` (string), `tags[]`, `draft` (default `false`), optional `image`.

## Authoring

Path: `content/posts/YYYY/kebab-slug.md`

```md
---
title: Clear title
description: One-sentence summary for cards and SEO.
date: 2026-07-24
tags: [nuxt, frontend]
draft: false
---
```

- Public queries always `.where('draft', '=', false)`.
- Format dates with `formatPostDate` from `~/utils/posts`.

## Querying

```ts
// list (paginate with POSTS_PER_PAGE / parsePostsPage)
queryCollection('posts')
  .where('draft', '=', false)
  .select('path', 'title', 'description', 'date', 'tags')
  .order('date', 'DESC').skip(…).limit(…).all()

// detail + surround
queryCollection('posts').path(route.path).where('draft', '=', false).first()
queryCollectionItemSurroundings('posts', route.path, { fields: ['title', 'description', 'date'] })
```

- Wrap in `useAsyncData` with a stable key; render with `<ContentRenderer :value="post" />`.
- Cards: `<PostsPostCard />`; home preview uses `POSTS_HOME_PREVIEW`.
